<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP's Ergo drops one yr fixed mortgages to 9.95 pc.</title>
<headline>AMP's Ergo drops one yr fixed mortgages to 9.95 pc.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP New Zealand subsidiary Ergo Personal Financial Services said on Friday it had cut its one year fixed mortgage rate to 9.95 percent from 10.45 percent.</p>
<p>The new interest rate takes effect immediately.</p>
<p>Ergo was maintaining its floating rate at 11.25 percent, managing director Graham Meyer said</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746.</p>
</text>
